  "body": "## What\n\nAdd the case `examples/catalog/multiaxis/indexed`: a block with pockets on two indexed faces (3+1) and on one tilted face (3+2).\n\n## Notes\n\nMachine: a file with a rotary axis from `assets/machines/` (for example `tilthead.mch`). #2392 puts the 3+1 part after #2389.\n\nDone means: The case folder obeys `examples/catalog/README.md`: `model/` with its generator script, `build.camscript`, `<case>.camproj`, `<case>.nc` and `README.md`. The geometry is original (Clean-Room Protocol). `cargo xtask catalog --check` and `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog` pass. The README says what the case shows and what to look at. The posted program shows the index moves. The collision check is clean.\n\nFile each refusal or wrong output that the work finds as its own bug. Link the bug on #2392. A missing parameter in an MCP tool is a new `area:mcp` issue.\n\nPart of #2392\n",
